      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Router and RouteMatcher; auth, cache, circuit, logging, generic rate-limit middleware\nproxyRequest(), connection.pool.ts, UpstreamClient, RetryHandler\nCacheControlParser, KeyBuilder, StaleWhileRevalidate, StaleIfError, TagInvalidator, PatternInvalidator\nMemoryStore, RedisStore, HybridStore, circuit state helper classes\nThese are useful library code, but the active master/worker flow uses the concrete logic described above.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Router and RouteMatcher; auth, cache, circuit, logging, generic rate-limit middleware\nproxyRequest(), connection.pool.ts, UpstreamClient, RetryHandler\nCacheControlParser, KeyBuilder, StaleWhileRevalidate, StaleIfError, TagInvalidator, PatternInvalidator\nMemoryStore, RedisStore, HybridStore, circuit state helper classes\nThese are useful library code, but the active master/worker flow uses the concrete logic described above.",
