    {
      "id": "e5RtulXC",
      "type": "text",
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bi5rdXRMI",
      "seed": 80187374,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 427652492,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789875096627,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "x": 3094,
      "y": 2572,
      "width": 1292,
      "height": 89,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2933",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "1. workers: 0 reaches createServer as 0, so it can fork no normal HTTP workers.\n2. bodyLimitMiddleware checks only Content-Length; chunked oversized bodies can still reach dispatch.\n3. matched routes fall back to all HEALTHY_UPSTREAMS when their own healthy set is empty.\n4. Redis client creation / injection currently checks storage === 'redis', not 'hybrid'.\n5. admin.pathPrefix and observability.metrics.path are schema fields, but handler paths are hard-coded.\n6. health state broadcasts occur on registry changes; active/passive probe transitions do not broadcast worker health updates.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. workers: 0 reaches createServer as 0, so it can fork no normal HTTP workers.\n2. bodyLimitMiddleware checks only Content-Length; chunked oversized bodies can still reach dispatch.\n3. matched routes fall back to all HEALTHY_UPSTREAMS when their own healthy set is empty.\n4. Redis client creation / injection currently checks storage === 'redis', not 'hybrid'.\n5. admin.pathPrefix and observability.metrics.path are schema fields, but handler paths are hard-coded.\n6. health state broadcasts occur on registry changes; active/passive probe transitions do not broadcast worker health updates.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
